defrauded many people and materially damaged one. One way to make sure
the scales get balanced -- that people know that Spaf was wrong, so his
rep loses and mine recovers -- is to have the claim arbitrated, to sue,
in short.
Detweiler is another fettle of kish. He could defend against your suit
by showing that no one believes a damn thing he says, or that the kind
of folx you hang out with don't hold Antichristhood against
you. That's another interesting aspect: lots of things that were once
